1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,750
13 Nov: every US flight grounded.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:07,750
Then email. Then banks. Down.

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:12,350
A bunker seller: one sold in 2018. Now one
a day.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,150
Generators: selling out.

5
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:22,300
The Vice President: no crisis is coming.
But be prepared.
